    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME welcome you to No.9 Castlesize Grove; a clean and well maintained 3 bedroom home nestled in this quiet cul-de sac within this popular residential development. No.9 benefits from an additional ground floor room which is often desired yet elusive for families looking for a playroom/home office or indeed an additional ground floor bedroom. Castlesize is a mature and sought after development which benefits from a good community feel and is within walking distance of the train station as well as the amenities of Sallins including The Greenway, supermarkets, gastro pubs and coffee shops. The larger town of Naas is also just a few minute's drive away. This fine home offers potential for a growing family and also benefits from a Southerly facing rear garden and off street parking for 2 cars (with electric charging point) Viewing strictly by appointment with sole agents CME 045-897711."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: c. 5.2m x 1.7m\r\nTiled Floor. Understairs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC: c. 1.8m x 1.m\r\nWith WC and wash hand basin\r\n\r\nLounge: c. 5.7m x 3.3m\r\nSolid wood floor. Bay window. Fireplace with tiled and timber surround. Double doors leading to …\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining: c. 5.2m x 3.6m\r\nRange of Oak effect wall and floor units incorporating breakfast bar. Single drainer stainless steel sink unit. Tiled splashback. Ceramic tiled floor. Sliding doors to rear.\r\n\r\nUtility Room: c. 2.6m x 1.2m\r\nPlumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. Wall mounted gas boiler. Tiled floor. Door leading to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Room/ Play Room: \r\nc. 4.9m x 2.7m \r\nTimber tongue and groove floor. Ideal family room/playroom/home office/ground floor bedroom.\r\n\r\nLanding: \r\nWith hotpress. Access to attic.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: c. 4.2m x 3.2m \r\nRear aspect. Tongue & groove flooring. Floor to ceiling built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: c. 4.2m x 1.7m\r\nWith white suite comprising WC, wash hand basin & shower enclosure. Tiled floor & wet areas. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.7m x 3.1m \r\nFront aspect. Tongue & groove timber flooring. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: c. 2.9m x 2.5m \r\nFront aspect. Tongue & groove flooring. Built in storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 2m x 1.9m\r\nWith White suite comprising WC, wash hand basin & walk in jet bath/shower. Electric shower. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nTo the front there is a cobblelock driveway with space for 2 cars. Electric car charging point. Gated side entrance leading to Southerly facing private garden which is laid in lawn with large patio area. Barna shed. Fully fenced with Mature trees and planting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 Bed with additional ground floor room ideal playroom/family room/home office\r\nPrivate cul -de-sac location\r\nClose to all amenities including, train station, shops and supermarkets\r\nWalking distance to The Greenway\r\nMaster bedroom en suite \r\nUtility room & guest WC\r\nGas fired central heating\r\n2 Car driveway with electric car charger \r\nSoutherly facing rear garden"
      },
      {
